; effect4_kit -- the native kit: a thin library over Lean's lowered code (docs/research/2026-10-16-native-kit/README.md).
;   The behaviours are Lean's, lowered by LCNF into ../../gen/api_gen.ml (the api closure,
;   ocaml/gen/roots.json): the call tree at a budget and its runs (Effect4.Run.Tree), the checker,
;   program and reply admission, each carrier's canonical image (Effect4.Run.Kit), and Lean's
;   authoring surface (Effect4.Program.Authoring). The modules here are host code over it: the
;   face and its one run (Kit), JSON by shapes (Kit_json), the authoring face (Kit_author), the
;   machine under a reactor (Kit_machine, over E4_host), the commands' requests (Kit_serve), the
;   animated view (Kit_view), and the authoring tool's shells: JSON lines (Kit_tool) and MCP
;   (Kit_mcp). The driver `eff` is bin/.

(library
 (name effect4_kit)
 (modules kit_json kit kit_author kit_machine kit_serve kit_view kit_tool kit_mcp)
 (flags (:standard -w -4-9-26-27-32-33-35-37-39-40-41-42-44-45-69-70))
 (libraries effect4_eff effect4_clock effect4_gen effect4_engine))
